  "title": "VIZSLA SILVER AWARDS EPCM AND MINE DESIGN CONTRACTS FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE PANUCO SILVER-GOLD PROJECT - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia (April 23, 2026) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G3) (“Vizsla Silver” or the “Company”) today announced that it has awarded the Engineering, Procurement and Construction Management (the “EPCM”) contract to M3 Engineering & Technology Corp. (“M3” or “M3 Engineering”) and has entered into a Mine Design contract with Mining Plus. Both contractors will […]",
